{"id":"vod_bf_22730","vodId":"22730","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"梦想夏乡","name_cn":"梦想夏乡","date":"2008-01-01","year":"2008","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-23/8b2c62e84078331422877d71e1c6b1d1.jpg"},"summary":"本片为同人社团舞风所制作的同人动画。　　幻想乡，一个于世界之外独立存在的美好国度，在那里，妖怪，人类，神灵，神兽共同生活在同一片天地下，彼此之间关系和睦又友好。在这里，没有悲伤，没有痛苦，没有战争，没有死亡，有的只是整日整日的闲散生活，和充斥在每一寸空气中的快乐。　　夏天即将到来，巫女博丽灵梦（中原麻衣 配音）所在的神社即将举行一年一度的夏日祭典，幻想乡的所有居民们都在期待着这一天的到来。就在这个节骨眼上，一连串怪事的发生让幻想乡陷入了危机之中。神社门口的钱柜遭窃，帕秋丽（高桥美佳子 配音）的藏书不知所踪，红魔馆的茶点消失不见，这几起事件的背后，究竟隐藏了怎样的真相？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"},{"name":"东方同人动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 02:16:37","playable":true,"episodeCount":10,"classic":true,"franchise":"touhou","fanWork":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/mengxiangxiaxiang/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/mengxiangxiaxiang/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/mengxiangxiaxiang/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/mengxiangxiaxiang/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/mengxiangxiaxiang/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/mengxiangxiaxiang/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/mengxiangxiaxiang/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/mengxiangxiaxiang/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/mengxiangxiaxiang/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/mengxiangxiaxiang/第10集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:15:28.019Z"}